Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Coffee & Tea, Food","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"wBa-Abx8y5SLOqbohCA4nQ","review_id":"_X5HzejhZsOmQ0NGl72g9g","date":"2016-06-30T04:53:05","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9544599056243896,"text_excerpt":"Located in The French Quarter, on the same street as the famous Cafe Du Monde (not too far away and is a short walk over). You can find this place behind the Jake's Brewery. Look for the green awning. This has got to be the very best beignets that I have ever had, especially in NOLA (the place I go to back at home comes in 2nd best out of all the beignets that we had tried). Don't send me hate mail, but honestly I love the beignets here (yes that means even better than Cafe Du Monde and Cafe Beignet) because they are light and fluffy. Anyways, after looking over the menu, we ordered: Order of Beignet, $3- One order comes with 3 pieces. There is plenty of powdered sugar but not a crazy ove..."},{"business_id":"wBa-Abx8y5SLOqbohCA4nQ","review_id":"vAyuX2HofYo_GkwZKEn8Hw","date":"2013-07-10T18:06:37","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9537514448165894,"text_excerpt":"Went here thinking it was Cafe Du Monde. Ended up trying both this place & Cafe Du Monde. I like this place much better. The beignets were light, fluffy, flaky and crispy on the outside. They were heavenly. The service was fast and super friendly. and the food was fresh. I would actually recommend these guys over Cafe' Du Monde. Same price, better beignets!!!"},{"business_id":"wBa-Abx8y5SLOqbohCA4nQ","review_id":"gQeQ57Gxnsue-9rLQwnGDg","date":"2016-09-07T17:21:47","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.946556031703949,"text_excerpt":"Great beignets! We had the peach filled ones and they were really yummy. The chicory coffee was also very good - note to self :-) order it iced next time as New Orleans is so hot :-). The cafe also sells nice souvenir paintings that looked different from all the same stuff sold in souvenir shops throughout the city. Also please note they take cash only."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"wBa-Abx8y5SLOqbohCA4nQ","photo_id":"WFVBMIdkblAVwlVo7ZVggA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/WFVBMIdkblAVwlVo7ZVggA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8940883278846741},{"business_id":"wBa-Abx8y5SLOqbohCA4nQ","photo_id":"H4Tw2veAYY4eRSFqEZsOog","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/H4Tw2veAYY4eRSFqEZsOog.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8790407180786133},{"business_id":"wBa-Abx8y5SLOqbohCA4nQ","photo_id":"Cz8YjUWtKs6HFkib6Lee7A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Cz8YjUWtKs6HFkib6Lee7A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8754622936248779},{"business_id":"wBa-Abx8y5SLOqbohCA4nQ","photo_id":"1tAm-dPtESRVUTvsH5gUpg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/1tAm-dPtESRVUTvsH5gUpg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8101733922958374},{"business_id":"wBa-Abx8y5SLOqbohCA4nQ","photo_id":"Zp7yWH2eLI00Zx2n29aT5w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Zp7yWH2eLI00Zx2n29aT5w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.80119788646698}]},"notebook_case":null}
